multiflexi-zabbix (2.4.3) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  [ CyberVitexus ]
  * Add Zabbix LLD for per-credential endpoint availability monitoring
    (states Available/Degraded/Unavailable/Misconfigured/Unknown; High-
    severity trigger on Unavailable).
  * Fix fatal error in credential availability check: initialize
    MultiFlexi\Defaults before invoking checkAvailability()
    (RaiffeisenBank and others read Defaults::$MULTIFLEXI_TMP during
    construction).
  * Fix zabbix/multiflexi-template.xml to actually import into current
    Zabbix versions (invalid trigger syntax, wrong trapper item type,
    non-UUIDv4 uuids, a broken calculated item, and other schema issues
    found by importing it into a live Zabbix 7.4 server).
  * Fix default value of {$CRED.AVAILABILITY.EXCLUDE}: an empty regex
    matches every string, so the previous empty default silently
    excluded every credential from discovery. Default is now "^$".

 -- CyberVitexus <cybervitexus@gmail.com>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 17:30:00 +0200

